findings.suggested_fix:
Replace with a numbered list of discrete work items, each with a description of the specific activity, the responsible party, and any measurable output. For example:

4.2 Services. The Provider shall perform the following Services:
(a) User research: conduct [X] user interviews and produce a research findings report;
(b) Visual design: deliver wireframes and high-fidelity mockups for [Y] portal screens;
(c) Build: develop and unit-test the portal in accordance with the technical specification agreed in writing by the Parties;
(d) Testing: conduct integration and user-acceptance testing against the acceptance criteria in Clause 6.1;
(e) Launch support: provide [Z] weeks of hypercare support following go-live.

Any activity not listed above is out of scope.

