4.2 Services. The Provider shall perform the following Services:
(a) User research: [describe specific research activities, number of sessions, participants, outputs];
(b) Visual design: [describe design artefacts, design system, number of rounds of review];
(c) Build: [describe technology stack, components to be built, integration points];
(d) Testing: [describe testing types, environments, entry and exit criteria];
(e) Launch support: [describe go-live activities, duration of hypercare, support scope].

